    "accordion_content_cDkVRL": {
      "type": "accordion-content",
      "blocks": {
        "item_izPhjJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is different about the Pro Series?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Pro Series includes multiple features that set it apart from the pack from other golf practice tools. This highly durable net is constructed with a powder-coated aluminum frame and UV-resistant polyester netting, which ensures long-lasting performance. Its portability and quick setup make it ideal for various spaces. The Pro Series delivers unmatched versatility for golf as well as other sports like soccer and baseball.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_cf97rU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What golf net does Bryson DeChambeau use?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Two-time U.S. Open champ Bryson DeChambeau uses The Net Return’s Pro Series net. Golfers looking to emulate Bryson’s practice regimen may benefit from the same training aids. The Pro Series is actually a favorite among many pros and amateurs—it’s among the must-have golf accessories for serious players.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_qNn7Ty": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does the Pro Series Nets have instant ball return?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Yes, the Pro Series nets feature a patented automatic ball return system, which directs the golf ball back to the user after every shot. This functionality is a game-changer, as it allows for uninterrupted practice and maximum practice efficiency. When used in conjunction with our other golf training aids, the Pro Series net becomes one of the most effective golf practice tools on the market. Whether you’re practicing your drives or refining your short game, this net ensures a first-rate training experience.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_UbTkTJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How hard is it to assemble a golf net?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Pro Series is designed for easy assembly, featuring a Quick Color Connect System that requires no tools and takes just minutes to set up. Detailed instructions and an intuitive design mean even beginners can assemble the net with little effort. For those seeking a golf net upgrade, the Pro Series offers a combination of ease of use and advanced functionality—another reason why it is one of the top home golf accessories on the market today.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_8xkFPa": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use the Pro Series outdoors?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Sure! The Pro Series is built for both indoor and outdoor use, thanks to its sturdy, rust-resistant aluminum frame and UV-protected netting. To maintain its longevity outdoors, you should pair it with a golf net outdoor cover from The Net Return to shield it from harsh weather. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_izPhjJ",
        "item_cf97rU",
