      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Frequently asked questions about pro series",
        "content": "<p>The Net Return’s Pro Series nets are versatile, durable training solutions for athletes of all skill levels. Perfect for golf and multi-sport use, it features automatic ball return, portability, and a robust design. Paired with The Net Return’s high-quality golf net accessories, it creates a professional-grade practice experience right at home. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned player, the Pro Series nets are an essential golf gear investment.  </p>",
